A||N||1||2xsess||Strange european cars here in Kosovo||||10||
Z||000000||2xsess||05-28-2001||06:35 PM||||Wow, I've seen some of the funkiest cars since I've been here. There's one that's a Daewoo that would make a Fiero look like a Caddy.  and these people drive like maniacs. Scary. But, they really calm down when an M1A1 tank comes rolling down the road towards them, but they don't hesitate to tailgate one either, and the funniest part about that is that the exhaust coming out of the rear to the turbine power tanks is rather HOT so once they get up close and feel that heat they tend to back off really quickly. <P>Otherwise all is going well over here in lovely Kosovo. <P>I hope everyone is well and their wheels are still round.<P>Take care,<BR>Jeff<P><BR>P.S. 2M4Dale, if you still have the address and want to post it that would be cool, I can't remember the entire thing and I keep forgeting to ask or write it down.||||reg||10
Z||000001||FieroJoe||05-29-2001||07:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 2xsess:<BR><B>But, they really calm down when an M1A1 tank comes rolling down the road towards them</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hahahaha!  If I saw one of those in my rearview I'd probably just crap my pants.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
